<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept diesel oil output up 14 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept diesel oil output up 14 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's diesel oil output totalled 32.59 million tonnes in the first nine months of 1996, up 14.0 percent compared with the same period of last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Diesel oil production in September alone was 3.60 million tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
</text>
